@startuml
title Sequence Diagram - Generate Study Plan

actor Student
participant "Website UI" as Website
participant "Flask API\n/api/plan" as API
participant "StudyPlanGenerator" as Planner
participant "JSON Response" as Response

Student -> Website : Enter course, difficulty,\nhours, goal, deadline
Student -> Website : Click "Generate Study Plan"

alt GitHub Pages deployed website
  Website -> Website : Validate input in browser
  Website -> Website : Generate study plan using\nbrowser-side logic
  Website --> Student : Display weekly plan and dashboard
else Local Flask application
  Website -> API : POST /api/plan\nJSON preferences
  API -> API : Validate request body
  API -> Planner : generate_plan(preferences)
  Planner --> API : Weekly study plan
  API -> Response : Build JSON response
  Response --> Website : Return plan data
  Website --> Student : Display weekly plan and dashboard
end

@enduml